          <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-cyan-50 rounded-2xl p-5 md:p-8 border-2 border-blue-200">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-base md:text-lg text-blue-800 mb-3 flex items-center">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                
<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
              </svg>
              お問い合わせ前にご確認ください
            </h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2 text-blue-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                </svg>
                譲渡には各団体の審査があります
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2 text-blue-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
           
       <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                </svg>
                譲渡費用（医療費等）が必要な場合があります
              </li>
              
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2 text-blue-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
